@OrderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Create order
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Notebook",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Get order by id
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/orders/1

### List orders
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/orders

### Via Kong (after gateway is running)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/orders
